/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 213 0 R
/T (Bitcoin \(BTC\), the cryptocurrency asset, was originally created to act as a digital medium of exchange. You can buy or sell Bitcoin on most, if not all, crypto exchanges or on dedicated Bitcoin exchanges. The process of generating new Bitcoin is called Bitcoin mining. It involves using powerful computers to process the complex mathematical equations needed to maintain the network.)
/E (Bitcoin \(BTC\), the cryptocurrency asset, was originally created to act as a digital medium of exchange. You can buy or sell Bitcoin on most, if not all, crypto exchanges or on dedicated Bitcoin exchanges. The process of generating new Bitcoin is called Bitcoin mining. It involves using powerful computers to process the complex mathematical equations needed to maintain the network.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
