/S /H3
/P 218 0 R
/T (Central banks can print unlimited amounts of fiat money, leading to inflation when the money supply increases. With its capped supply and programmatic halvings, Bitcoin is designed to avoid this problem.)
/E (Central banks can print unlimited amounts of fiat money, leading to inflation when the money supply increases. With its capped supply and programmatic halvings, Bitcoin is designed to avoid this problem.)
/Pg 14 0 R
