/P 224 0 R
/ActualText (Liquidity: As more people use Bitcoin, it should become easier to buy and sell, meaning Bitcoin's liquidity increases. This is because greater adoption leads to more buyers and sellers in the market, which is particularly important as institutional adoption continues growing.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
